  "exchange_coefficient_shift": {
   "description": "Shift of a sqrt exchange coefficient from the 10-m neutral reference to the measurement height and stability (flux_atmocn_Large.F90:282-284): c(zbot) = c_n / (1 + c_n/karman*(alz - psi)), applied to rd (momentum, psi = psimh), rh (heat, psi = psixh) and re (water, psi = psixh) with the neutral values rdn/rhn/ren. alz = ln(zbot/10) and psi are dimensionless and c is a sqrt coefficient, so the template is dimensionless.",
   "params": [
    "c",
    "alz",
    "psi"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "/",
    "args": [
     "c",
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 1.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           "c",
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 0.4,
            "units": "1"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           "alz",
           "psi"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "exchange_coefficient_shift_clamped": {
   "description": "The clamped variant of the coefficient shift used for the 10-m neutral wind reconstruction (flux_atmocn_Large.F90:272): rd = rdn / (1 + max(rdn/karman*(alz - psimh), -0.5)), u10n = vmag*rd/rdn. The max(..., -0.5) clamp of F90:272 (a guard against the denominator collapsing for very unstable conditions) applies to the momentum shift only, and only in this wind-shift step; the unclamped shift of F90:282-284 is exchange_coefficient_shift.",
   "params": [
    "c",
    "alz",
    "psi"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "/",
    "args": [
     "c",
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 1.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       {
        "op": "max",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
             "c",
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": 0.4,
              "units": "1"
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
             "alz",
             "psi"
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": -0.5,
          "units": "1"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
