   "description": "Neutral 10-m sqrt heat exchange coefficient (flux_atmocn_Large.F90:238): rhn = (1 - stable)*0.0327 + stable*0.018, the Large & Pond ratio Ch/CD selected by the stability factor (0.0327 unstable, 0.018 stable; the commented chxcdu/chxcds names of F90:239).",
